  "humanDescription": "A compact microscope that reveals bee genetics instantly, without turning knowledge into a payout.\n^blue;Upper input: On/Off (unwired = on)^reset;\n^blue;Lower input: Item network input^reset;\n^red;Output: Item network output^reset;",
  "apexDescription": "A focused genetic viewer. It exposes bee data while producing no research or currency.\n^blue;Upper input: On/Off (unwired = on)^reset;\n^blue;Lower input: Item network input^reset;\n^red;Output: Item network output^reset;",
  "avianDescription": "A careful lens for reading the hidden traits of bees. Nothing is extracted except information.\n^blue;Upper input: On/Off (unwired = on)^reset;\n^blue;Lower input: Item network input^reset;\n^red;Output: Item network output^reset;",
  "floranDescription": "Microscope showsss bee genesss. No rewardsss, just knowingss.\n^blue;Upper input: On/Off (unwired = on)^reset;\n^blue;Lower input: Item network input^reset;\n^red;Output: Item network output^reset;",
  "glitchDescription": "Analytical. This instrument reveals a bee's genetic data without generating a material reward.\n^blue;Upper input: On/Off (unwired = on)^reset;\n^blue;Lower input: Item network input^reset;\n^red;Output: Item network output^reset;",
  "hylotlDescription": "A restrained scientific instrument that reveals genetic structure without commodifying the specimen.\n^blue;Upper input: On/Off (unwired = on)^reset;\n^blue;Lower input: Item network input^reset;\n^red;Output: Item network output^reset;",
  "novakidDescription": "A little lens that tells you what a bee is carrying genetically. No payout attached.\n^blue;Upper input: On/Off (unwired = on)^reset;\n^blue;Lower input: Item network input^reset;\n^red;Output: Item network output^reset;",
